<title>USA: WBT buys American Filtrona for $46.52/shr.</title>
<headline>WBT buys American Filtrona for $46.52/shr.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Filtrona Corp said on Friday it agreed to be acquired by WBT Holdings LLC for $46.52 in cash per share.</p>
<p>American Filtrona was trading at 43 on the Nasdaq exchange in the late morning.</p>
<p>WBT said it will then sell American Filtrona's bonded fibers business to Bunzl PLC, a British-based firm, for $72.45 million.</p>
<p>WBT is owned by several trusts for the benefit of the family of the late Walter Bunzl.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
